@ProcurementService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047

GET {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "items": [
    {
      "productGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
      "quantity": 20,
      "unitPrice": 450.00
    },
    {
      "productGuid": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa7",
      "quantity": 10,
      "unitPrice": 150.00
    }
  ]
}

### 1. Submit PO for Manager Approval (Draft -> PendingApproval)
POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/submit
Accept: application/json

### 2. Approve PO (Human Manager Approval: PendingApproval -> Approved)
POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/approve
Accept: application/json

### 3. Reject PO (Manager Rejection: PendingApproval -> Rejected)
POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Budget threshold exceeded for this quarter."
}

### 4. Send PO to Supplier (Approved -> Sent)
POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/send
Accept: application/json

### 5. Receive Goods (Sent -> Received)
POST {{ProcurementService_HostAddress}}/api/purchaseorders/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/receive
Accept: application/json

###

